flowchart TD
    A[Raw Extracted Field] --> B{Data Type Normalization}
    
    B -->|Date| C[Parse to YYYY-MM-DD]
    B -->|Numeric| D[Strip non-digits, cast to Float]
    
    C --> E{Validation Engine}
    D --> E
    
    E --> F[Check Presence / Required]
    E --> G[Check Reference Ranges]
    E --> H[Check Source Mismatch]
    
    F & G & H --> I[Calculate Confidence Score]
    
    I --> J{Confidence > Threshold & Valid?}
    
    J -->|Yes| K[Set Field VALID]
    J -->|No| L[Set Field LOW_CONFIDENCE / OUT_OF_RANGE]
    
    K & L --> M{Any fields invalid?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Document: REVIEW_REQUIRED]
    M -->|No| O[Document: AUTO_ACCEPTED]
